+    <key name="alert-sound-full-channels" type="aq">
+      <default>[4370, 4383]</default>
+      <summary>Channels whose alerts sound at full volume</summary>
+      <description>
+        Alerts on these channels play the alert tone on the speakers at full
+        volume, unmuted, and on every connected device (Bluetooth, USB,
+        headphones) at that device's own volume. The defaults are the
+        presidential alert channels (3GPP TS 23.041).
+      </description>
+    </key>
+
+    <key name="alert-sound-raised-channels" type="aq">
+      <default>[4371, 4384]</default>
+      <summary>Channels whose alerts sound at half volume or more</summary>
+      <description>
+        Alerts on these channels play the alert tone on the connected devices
+        only, at their own volume, when there are any, and otherwise on the
+        speakers at half volume or the user's volume, whichever is higher.
+        Alerts on other channels play a short chime at the user's volume when
+        they are shown as notifications.
+      </description>
+    </key>
